#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:152
#: c007cc0c58584145958da1cb11be5795
msgid "Set :ref:`BATT_MONITOR <BATT_MONITOR>` to 4 (= analog voltage and current) and reboot for full battery monitoring support."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:156
#: 18f23d2cd9264d988ba2a56ba023756f
msgid "Current pin defaults to pin 11 in ardupilot runtime. Alternatively, it can be used for analog RSSI input or connecting an analog airspeed sensor. Adjust :ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` default of 18.2 as required by the individual current sensor hardware used."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:160
#: dc8730e042154a9988326a113fdd16ba
msgid "Flashing Firmware"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:161
#: 33ff933a77b64373ae1314dba7810e86
msgid "Usually these boards are sold pre-flashed with Betaflight / iNav firmwares. In order to use ArduPilot, first time flashing requires both the bootloader and the firmware to be updated. Subsequent ArduPilot firmware updates do not require updating the bootloader again."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:164
#: ed3cc559a1534ead84676e7a3576435b
msgid "First time flashing"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:166
#: a14a3c7b9ef44dce87e3d4323c6d8f3a
msgid "Follow the instructions `here <https://ardupilot.org/plane/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.html>`__ using the \"arduXXX_with_bl.hex\" file for the \"OmnibusNanoV6\" target."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:168
#: fc7c50769bf54aaa977708679a349444
msgid "When instructed to enter DFU mode, locate the DFU button / jumper pads and keep the button pressed / jumper pads shorted while connecting the board to your computer via USB. If done successfully, the red power LED should light solid while the blue activity LED should not light at all."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:174
#: 27a746ba2cdb440c8f1f3dd266104cdb
msgid "Subsequent firmware updates"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:176
#: 5f40050be8d24bafa47501342f65b2bf
msgid "Follow the instructions `here <https://ardupilot.org/plane/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.html>`__ but choose \"Load Custom Firmware\" and browse to the respective \"arduXXX.apj\" file for the \"OmnibusNanoV6\" target, or your own .apj file if building your own firmware."
msgstr ""

